495 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 289 0 R
/E (A sentence changed, a picture adjusted, a page moved, an idea reconsidered. None of these things may stand out on their own, but together, they are what make the book what it is. And then, after all that work, something beautiful happens. The book leaves the hands that made it and finds its way into someone else's.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
496 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 289 0 R
/E (A story that was once being shaped on a page becomes a bedtime favourite, a classroom companion, a gift between friends, or a quiet moment shared with oneself. That is when a book truly comes alive. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
